   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark romantic: median ~58, olive-green shadows (36,40,27), green-yellow tinted highlights (211,212,198), orange+yellow 64%, teal sky (82,115,122 / hue 190), foliage in 3/4 of frames, saturation 0.30. Best for: Forests, castles and ruins, waterfalls, misty valleys, monsoon greenery, heritage forts in rain, fairytale pre-wedding stories. Dark and green - not for bright beach frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
